WEBVTT

00:05:58.836 --> 00:06:02.276
Well, I interviewed over 500 women
of color in writing this book,

00:06:02.316 --> 00:06:03.556
and I don't believe that.

00:06:03.556 --> 00:06:06.596
I think we can undo anything
that has come before.

00:06:06.636 --> 00:06:09.076
We just have to give ourselves
permission to do it.

00:06:09.076 --> 00:06:12.316
And I also think this is where
it's not just upon women of color.

00:06:12.316 --> 00:06:14.236
So I wrote this book for women of color,

00:06:14.276 --> 00:06:17.756
but I'm going to share with you
that it's a lot of allies, white leaders,

00:06:17.756 --> 00:06:20.476
men and women and others
who are picking it up and saying,

00:06:20.516 --> 00:06:22.716
“This is really helpful
for me to understand,

00:06:22.756 --> 00:06:24.836
and a lot of the concepts
apply to me too."

00:06:24.876 --> 00:06:27.476
I want to share that,
I use the term women of color,

00:06:27.516 --> 00:06:29.676
I know that's not applicable
in all countries,

00:06:29.716 --> 00:06:32.676
but I do think the concepts
we're talking about are applicable,